DTEND:20261031T120000Z
SUMMARY:Upcoming maintenance for the Customers Portal
DESCRIPTION:We’ll be performing database maintenance for the Customers Por
 tal (customers.gitlab.com) on Saturday\, 31 October\, from 11:00 to 12:00 
 UTC. We apologize for the short notice. This maintenance is needed to help
  preserve stability.\n\nThe Customers Portal and its APIs will be temporar
 ily unavailable during this window. We’ll update this notice when the main
 tenance begins and when it’s complete.
END:VEVENT
