DTSTART:20221126T143000Z
DTEND:20221126T160000Z
SUMMARY:Customers Portal Database Migration
DESCRIPTION:We plan to migrate the database behind the GitLab Customers Po
 rtal from a VM to GCP CloudSQL\, for better manageability and maintenance.
  The Customers Portal will be offline for approximately one hour during th
 e maintenance window with an additional 30 minute buffer added in order to
  verify stability.
END:VEVENT
