SUMMARY:Potential Service Disruptions
DESCRIPTION:Early morning\, Friday 09 August at 02:00 UTC we will be perfo
 rming maintenance to  apply configuration changes on Consul agents.  Hosts
  responsible for maintaining database connections rely on consul advertisi
 ng the primary database In the event the clients lose connectivity to the 
 Consul servers\, users may see errors as a result of the lost connectivity
 .\n\nWe expect the maintenance will be brief and that all systems will res
 ume normal operations after only a few minutes. Please see  https://gitlab
 .com/gitlab-com/gl-infra/production/issues/1042 for more details for more 
 information.
